# Bargain (CR 702.166a) is an optional additional cost: Bot1 sacrifices Mox Ruby, so Agatha's Champion enters bargained and
# its enters trigger (CR 603.4: if it was bargained) fights Bot2's Hill Giant. The 4/4 takes 3 damage and kills the 3/3, and
# the Lotuses' six mana paid for the Champion alone ({4}{G}); the bargain cost was the sacrifice, not mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Agatha's Champion
Forest
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Hill Giant
Mountain x17

